  {
    "id": "ch09-try-doulepsa",
    "type": "form",
    "skill": "grammar",
    "level": "A2",
    "topics": [
      "stage:past"
    ],
    "rubric": {
      "el": "Διαλέγω το σωστό.",
      "en": "Choose the right form.",
      "tr": "Doğru biçimi seç."
    },
    "grammar": [
      "verb.aorist"
    ],
    "cue": {
      "lemma": "δουλεύω",
      "person": "1sg",
      "tense": "aorist"
    },
    "text": "Χθες εγώ {1} στο φαρμακείο.",
    "answer": {
      "1": [
        "δούλεψα"
      ]
    },
    "options": {
      "1": [
        "δούλεψα",
        "δουλεύω",
        "θα δουλέψω"
      ]
    },
    "translation": {
      "en": "Yesterday I worked at the pharmacy.",
      "tr": "Dün eczanede çalıştım."
    },
    "explain": {
      "en": "χθες (yesterday) means it is over: the aorist. The stem is the future's (θα δουλέψω) and the I-ending is -α: δούλεψα. It already has three syllables, so no έ-.",
      "tr": "χθες (dün) = bitmiş iş: aorist. Kök gelecek zamanınki (θα δουλέψω), ben eki -α: δούλεψα. Zaten üç hece var, έ- gelmez."
    },
    "source": {
      "doc": "chapter",
      "stage": "past",
      "by": "claude-sonnet"
    }
  },
